-- Regression-suite seed, loaded on top of data/sql/createdb.sql by
-- tests/setup/globalSetup.mjs. Keys are fixed so tests can refer to them;
-- sequences are bumped past them at the bottom. Every row exists to pin a
-- specific behaviour -- the comment says which. Media files for these rows
-- are generated by tests/helpers/media.mjs (writeSeedMedia).
--
-- All accounts share the password  Test-Passw0rd!  (bcrypt cost 4 for speed).

